TI  - Mix Data or Merge Models? Balancing the Helpfulness, Honesty, and Harmlessness of Large Language Model via Model Merging
AU  - Jinluan Yang
AU  - Dingnan Jin
AU  - Anke Tang
AU  - Li Shen
AU  - Didi Zhu
AU  - Zhengyu Chen
